Generate the commit message text. Do not add files, stage, or push the commit.

## Commit Message Requirements

- Concise, structured, strictly relevant to the changes
- Keep length to necessary minimum. No blabber.
- Example: `"Add hybrid search module with vector + graph traversal"` / `"Fix builder entity type enum usage"`
- See [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) for full commit guidelines
